{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act13side_level_act13side_02_beg",
  "groupId": "act13side",
  "stageId": "act13side_02",
  "title": "垂死的刺",
  "storyCode": "NL-2",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act13side/level_act13side_02_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "113eca8ce31681bb4867d7070565b1d61b62a450706227b935c15c29ec6eaea5",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡西米尔2 2-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "喝啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "參賽騎士",
      "text": "你這感染者——竟敢——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "退場吧，這裡不適合你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "參賽騎士",
      "text": "嘖！至少要把你拉出得分圈！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "——！唔！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "還好，分數還在——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "text": "是嗎？礦石病垃圾？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "唔！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "嘖，英格拉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的觀眾",
      "text": "好樣的！鏽銅！就這樣！把他逼出得分圈！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的觀眾",
      "text": "打爛他的手！就這樣！別讓這個感染者得手！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謹慎的觀眾",
      "text": "噓！小點聲！你看那邊的觀眾席......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動地觀眾",
      "text": "啊啊？那塊怎麼就坐著她一個人......“感染者騎士席位”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謹慎的觀眾",
      "text": "小聲點，她往這邊看過來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的觀眾",
      "text": "哈，座位之間不是有隔離牆嗎？她什麼都聽不見吧？再說，難道感染者還敢翻過來打我不成？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "這才叫騎士劍術，英格拉，你那直來直往的動作真讓人看不下去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "text": "啐......感染者雜碎......也敢教訓我？等我把你剝皮拆骨......你會後悔的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "（果然是個一點就著的莽夫......就這樣等著他失去理智......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "（唔，來了......！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "text": "該死的感染者垃圾——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "——垃圾？我怎麼感覺，是你們這些不求上進的騎士，要更弱一點呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "text": "咕，竟然能把我彈開......！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "text": "不，你那把短兵做不到這種事情......是源石技藝，風的法術？還是單純的推力？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "我會告訴你嗎？奧爾默·英格拉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "text": "你——看我這一擊！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "（突然——！？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "text": "嘖，果然是風嗎......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "text": "看來只是能輔助移動的水準，比起風騎士那種精神病還是差了很多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "（試探......？他原來不只是個頭腦簡單的廢物嗎......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "text": "哼，感染者......你那把劍並沒有安裝施術單元，你卻能施放法術......噁心，你體內骯髒的源石給你帶來的法術改變不了勝負......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "text": "血騎士那傢伙也是，就因為冒出幾個稍微有點虛名的感染者騎士，他就要逼迫普通民眾承認感染者嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "text": "監正會對你們也太好了點吧，要懂得感恩戴德，礦石病垃圾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "......感恩？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "對你們嗎......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "text": "......哈，你是什麼態度？在卡西米爾最底層匍匐掙扎的感染者，竟然反而看不起騎士貴族們嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "感染者......你知道感染者為了一個合法身份要付出多少代價嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "text": "哈，我為什麼要知道？我只知道你接下來會死得很慘——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "你知道剛產完卵就被捕捉的雌性鉗獸有多兇暴嗎？你知道，感染者騎士的選拔......是默許殺人的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "哦，“你會死得很慘”，大放厥詞啊，奧爾默·英格拉，你只是在享受欺壓弱小......你根本不敢傾力廝殺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "——你見過被判定為廉價的生命是怎麼被處理的嗎？騎士貴族垃圾？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的觀眾",
      "text": "現在還牢牢站在得分圈裡的只有五個了！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的觀眾",
      "text": "*卡西米爾粗口*，我花了所有的錢押寶，結果那個廢物三十分鐘都沒進過得分圈？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聒噪的觀眾",
      "text": "怎麼還有個感染者？那個感染者在和“鏽銅”英格拉作戰？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的觀眾",
      "text": "喂！幹掉那些骯髒的傢伙！英格拉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的觀眾",
      "text": "英格拉！英格拉！英格拉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的觀眾",
      "text": "怎、怎麼了？地震了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聒噪的觀眾",
      "text": "不、不，是那邊那個感染者騎士......她剛才狠狠踹了一腳地面......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "......嘖。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "這些傢伙......開始圍攻感染者了嗎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "怎麼樣！？英格拉，嘗到苦頭了嗎！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "唔......被包圍了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "text": "......感染者......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "text": "你不該站在這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "嗚——！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "正經的騎士",
      "text": "感染者，棄權吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "正經的騎士",
      "text": "我不喜歡英格拉的做派，但無論是我的騎士團還是我的家族，都不會容忍感染者與我們同台競技的恥辱......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "你這......淨說漂亮話......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "正經的騎士",
      "text": "別誤會了，最後能站在得分圈裡的本來就只有一個人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "正經的騎士",
      "text": "這是一場亂戰，感染者，只不過現在，你似乎成為眾矢之的了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "......嘁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "text": "不知死活的小崽子......等我解決感染者之後，就是你們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諂媚的騎士",
      "text": "英格拉閣下......我已經負傷，難以爭奪冠軍，但至少現在，我們該聯手擊垮那個感染者奴隸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諂媚的騎士",
      "text": "這些下賤的感染者，竟敢對騎士大放厥詞。你們也是，都知道先前感染者引起的騷動吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諂媚的騎士",
      "text": "紅松騎士團本來就滿是嫌疑，傳言非法聚集感染者的幕後主使就是他們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諂媚的騎士",
      "text": "利用和我們同台競技贏得來的財富，去禍害卡瓦萊利亞基乃至整個卡西米爾的安危？我們該縱容這種行為嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "......非法感染者？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "我看到的，只是一群無家可歸的可憐人，從工廠、農莊和鬥獸場被拋棄的可憐人！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "text": "別嚷嚷，感染者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "text": "你們要是真的這麼想，就該乖乖滾去感染者收容地區......而不是留在這裡，任人宰割。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "text": "實話實說吧，你，巴不得殺光所有騎士，對吧？你滿腔憤怒，渴望復仇，不是嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "text": "那你還等什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "——你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "嘎啊——哈、哈——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "text": "廢物！我會把你的手折下來，用它扇你耳光！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "（不行，不能繼續纏鬥下去，得先——）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "正經的騎士",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諂媚的騎士",
      "text": "......此路不通。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "你們......給我讓——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "唔！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "該死......你們在做什麼！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諂媚的騎士",
      "text": "我們只是站在這裡而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "正經的騎士",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "text": "這次你無路可逃了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "嘎啊......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "text": "......哦，盔甲材質不錯，否則你的脊樑骨已經斷了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "嘎哈......嘎哈......咳、咳咳......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諂媚的騎士",
      "text": "我不明白為什麼騎士協會會允許你們這種人參加特錦賽......你們的血難道不是劇毒嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "正經的騎士",
      "text": "......慢著。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "正經的騎士",
      "text": "感染者，離開這裡，棄權吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "正經的騎士",
      "text": "你已經受了很重的傷，繼續下去，你接下來的比賽就全部泡湯了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "——閉嘴！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
